[ti:Down by the Old Mill Stream]
[ar:Tell Taylor]
[00:00.00]Down by the old mill stream
[00:28.00]Where I first met you
[00:45.00]With your eyes of blue
[00:52.00]Dressed in gingham too
[01:08.00]It was there I knew
[01:18.00]That you loved me too
[01:36.00]You were sixteen, my village queen
[01:51.00]By the old mill stream
